      "position": [
        2128,
        -384
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 1040,
        "content": "## Commercial Property Cleaning Quote Request Pipeline\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow turns commercial property cleaning quote requests from a website form into qualified internal estimates. It validates incoming submissions, uses AI to interpret cleaning requirements, calculates labor and quote ranges, checks job fit, then generates an estimator-ready summary. Qualified leads are logged to Google Sheets and followed up with an email notification or message.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect the JotForm credential and select the website quote form that collects contact details and property requirements.\n- Configure the Google Gemini/LangChain credentials used by both AI Agent nodes and confirm the structured output schemas match the downstream fields.\n- Set the required field validation, labor-hour formula, hourly rate range, and lead quality/job-fit filter criteria for your cleaning business.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and choose the target spreadsheet/table for appending or updating quote records.\n- Connect Gmail credentials and configure the recipient, subject, and message body for the final notification.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the labor-hour assumptions, hourly rates, property-type rules, AI prompts, and qualification thresholds to match different service areas, building types, or quoting policies.\n\n@[youtube](5QmlxcOuuSg)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
