        "text": "=Write a professional, warm, and clear quotation email to send directly to the client based on their submission details.\n\nCustomer: {{ $('Set Submission Details').item.json['Full Name'] }}\n\nProperty Type: {{ $('Set Submission Details').item.json['Property Type'] }}\n\nAddress: {{ $('Set Submission Details').item.json.Address }}\n\nApprox Sq Ft: {{ $('Set Submission Details').item.json['Approximate Square Feet'] }}\n\nExtra Bathrooms: {{ $('Quote Analysis Agent').item.json.output.extra_bathrooms }}\n\nExtra Kitchens: {{ $('Quote Analysis Agent').item.json.output.extra_kitchens }}\n\nSpecial Requirements: {{ $('Normalize Requirements Data').item.json['Notes Summary'] }}\n\nQuote Range: ${{$json['Quote Low'] }} - ${{$json['Quote High'] }}\n\nYou are a courteous client success specialist. Ensure the tone is transparent, reassuring, and easy to read on mobile devices.\n\nNOTE:\nsummary_html, urgency_rating, subject_line, lead_quality_score(for 100), next_step ARE THE OUTPUT VARIABLES",
